  "title": "Nabis Partners With Equity Trade Network To Distribute BIPOC Brands In World’s Largest Cannabis Market",
  "summary": "Nabis, the leading licensed cannabis wholesale platform in the world’s largest legal cannabis market, today announced a partnership with Equity Trade Network, a California organization devoted to nurturing, spotlighting and promoting cannabis businesses led by people impacted by the War on Drugs.",
